  "description": "UPIXEZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H80 Er4 N34 Na2 O16. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 4 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.785-4.094 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.37-121.66°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C88H84Er4N34Na2O18. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
